window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>She ran from betrayal and found something even more dangerous…fate.</i></b></p> <p>Dakota Westwood has nothing left. Betrayed by her fiancé and stripped of her inheritance, she flees east with nothing but scraps of cash and a cryptic message from her grandfather: “Go east to the wolves.” Exhausted and desperate, she stumbles onto the lands of Copper Canyon Ranch…and straight into the path of a man who radiates danger and salvation in equal measure.</p> <p>Landon Savage likes his solitude. The wolf shifter is used to quiet days on the ranch, far from pack politics and mate drama. But when a mysterious woman trespasses on his land, bruised and clearly running from something, Landon’s instincts roar to life. She’s his mate. And she has no idea.</p> <p>As Dakota rebuilds her life in the heart of shifter territory, old secrets rise—and so does her ex, determined to drag her back. But Landon’s not about to let anyone touch what’s his. Not the pack. Not her past. Not even fate itself.</p> <p><i>A stolen inheritance. A hidden legacy. And a fated love written in the stars and sealed with a growl.</i></p>"; 
